  "headline": "FDA's records show cyclophosphamide supplied from a plant with VAI inspections in 2018 and 2026; drug not on FDA shortage list today",
  "headline_cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd. (Jinqiao Road Site) as the manufacturing plant for cyclophosphamide labeled by Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1053330 at that plant ended on 2018-04-13 and was classified VAI, with the classification known on 2018-06-14.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A more recent FDA inspection 1319132 at the same plant ended on 2026-04-15 and was also classified VAI, with the classification known on 2026-07-14.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of today 2026-10-21, cyclophosphamide does not appear on FDA's drug shortage list.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 54 units with 20 days on hand at current use, and Corvale General holds 63 units with 22 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Avenacy, LLC, whose plant is EPIC PHARMA LLC; verify that this source is available and meets formulary requirements.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
